Dear Tru64 Managers,

on an ES80 we try to use rad_gh_regions.

System config:
ES80, 6 CPU, 12 GB in 3 Drawers.
Tru64 TruCluster V5.1B PK3 NHD7 + aio Patch
Sybase database with nearly 6BG shared memory

MBM> show memory
